###############################################################################
# Intent Chat — Conversa multi-turno com IA sobre categorias de intenção
#
# Permite ao usuário ter conversas completas com a IA sobre uma categoria
# de intenção (ex: pain_and_anger). A IA mantém histórico e contexto
# da conversa para respostas coerentes em follow-ups.
#
# PRÉ-REQUISITO: Intent Classification (Theme 02) precisa ter sido executada
#   com status "ready" para contexto rico. Funciona sem, mas com limitações.
#
# FLUXO COMPLETO:
#   1. POST   /{category}/chat                       → Criar conversa (recebe conversation_id)
#   2. POST   /{category}/chat/{conv_id}/messages    → Enviar mensagem (recebe resposta IA)
#   3. POST   /{category}/chat/{conv_id}/messages    → Enviar follow-up (IA lembra contexto)
#   4. GET    /{category}/chat                       → Listar conversas do usuário
#   5. GET    /{category}/chat/{conv_id}/messages    → Ver histórico de mensagens
#   6. DELETE /{category}/chat/{conv_id}             → Arquivar conversa (soft delete)
#
# CONTEXTO DO AGENTE:
#   Mesmo contexto do Intent Ask (emotions, keywords, pain patterns, themes)
#   + histórico das últimas 40 mensagens da conversa
#
# CATEGORIAS SUPORTADAS:
#   - pain_and_anger
#   - solution_request
#
# FEATURES:
#   - Título auto-gerado a partir da primeira pergunta
#   - Soft delete (is_active = false, histórico preservado)
#   - context_quality atualizado a cada mensagem
#   - updated_at atualizado a cada interação
###############################################################################

@base_url = http://localhost:8000
@token = REPLACE_WITH_JWT_TOKEN

# IDs de exemplo — substitua pelos seus
@audience_id = REPLACE_WITH_AUDIENCE_ID
@conversation_id = REPLACE_WITH_CONVERSATION_ID

###############################################################################
# 1. CRIAR NOVA CONVERSA
###############################################################################

### Iniciar conversa sobre Pain & Anger
# Cria uma sessão de chat. Retorna conversation_id para enviar mensagens.
#
# Query params:
#   - window: week | month (default: week)
#
# Resposta esperada:
# {
#   "conversation_id": "uuid-da-conversa",
#   "intent_category": "pain_and_anger",
#   "context_quality": "rich",          ← "rich" se intent classification ready
#   "suggestion": null                  ← ou mensagem se "limited"
# }
#
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat?window=week
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Esperado: 200 com conversation_id
### IMPORTANTE: Copie o conversation_id da resposta e atualize @conversation_id acima

###############################################################################
# 2. ENVIAR PRIMEIRA MENSAGEM
###############################################################################

### Primeira pergunta na conversa
# O título da conversa será auto-gerado a partir desta pergunta.
#
# Resposta esperada:
# {
#   "answer": "Com base na análise de intenções, as principais frustrações...",
#   "context_quality": "rich",
#   "message_id": "uuid-da-mensagem",
#   "conversation_id": "uuid-da-conversa",
#   "suggestion": null
# }
#
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat/{{conversation_id}}/messages?window=week
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question": "Quais são as principais frustrações e dores dessa audiência?"
}

###############################################################################
# 3. ENVIAR FOLLOW-UP (A IA LEMBRA DO CONTEXTO)
###############################################################################

### Segunda pergunta — a IA considera a conversa anterior
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat/{{conversation_id}}/messages?window=week
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question": "E quais padrões de dor são mais recorrentes entre esses?"
}

### Esperado: resposta que referencia a conversa anterior sobre "frustrações"

###

### Terceira pergunta — pedindo ação com base no contexto acumulado
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat/{{conversation_id}}/messages?window=week
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question": "Com base nisso, que tipo de conteúdo eu deveria criar para ajudar essas pessoas?"
}

### Esperado: resposta prática que conecta as dores/padrões com sugestões de conteúdo

###

### Quarta pergunta — drill-down em comunidade específica
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat/{{conversation_id}}/messages?window=week
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question": "Quais comunidades concentram mais posts de dor e sobre quais assuntos?"
}

###############################################################################
# 4. CONVERSA SOBRE SOLUTION REQUEST
###############################################################################

### Criar conversa sobre Solution Requests
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/solution_request/chat?window=week
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Esperado: 200 com conversation_id para solution_request
### IMPORTANTE: Copie o conversation_id da resposta para usar abaixo

###

### Primeira pergunta sobre soluções buscadas
# Substitua SOLUTION_CONV_ID pelo conversation_id retornado acima
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/solution_request/chat/SOLUTION_CONV_ID/messages?window=week
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question": "Quais tipos de ferramentas e soluções essa audiência mais procura?"
}

###

### Follow-up sobre oportunidades de produto
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/solution_request/chat/SOLUTION_CONV_ID/messages?window=week
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question": "Com base nesses pedidos, que produto eu poderia criar para atender essa demanda?"
}

###############################################################################
# 5. LISTAR CONVERSAS DO USUÁRIO
###############################################################################

### Listar conversas sobre Pain & Anger
# Retorna conversas do usuário autenticado, mais recentes primeiro.
#
# Resposta esperada:
# {
#   "conversations": [
#     {
#       "conversation_id": "uuid",
#       "title": "Quais são as principais frustrações e dores dessa audiência?",
#       "intent_category": "pain_and_anger",
#       "context_quality": "rich",
#       "is_active": true,
#       "created_at": "2026-03-03T14:30:00+00:00",
#       "updated_at": "2026-03-03T14:35:00+00:00"
#     },
#     ...
#   ]
# }
#
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar conversas sobre Solution Requests
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/solution_request/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################################################
# 6. VER HISTÓRICO DE MENSAGENS
###############################################################################

### Listar mensagens de uma conversa
# Retorna mensagens em ordem cronológica (mais antigas primeiro).
#
# Resposta esperada:
# {
#   "conversation_id": "uuid",
#   "title": "Quais são as principais frustrações...",
#   "intent_category": "pain_and_anger",
#   "context_quality": "rich",
#   "is_active": true,
#   "messages": [
#     {
#       "message_id": "uuid",
#       "role": "user",
#       "content": "Quais são as principais frustrações...",
#       "context_quality": null,
#       "created_at": "2026-03-03T14:30:00+00:00"
#     },
#     {
#       "message_id": "uuid",
#       "role": "assistant",
#       "content": "Com base na análise de intenções...",
#       "context_quality": "rich",
#       "created_at": "2026-03-03T14:30:05+00:00"
#     },
#     {
#       "message_id": "uuid",
#       "role": "user",
#       "content": "E quais padrões de dor são mais recorrentes?",
#       "context_quality": null,
#       "created_at": "2026-03-03T14:31:00+00:00"
#     },
#     {
#       "message_id": "uuid",
#       "role": "assistant",
#       "content": "Os padrões mais recorrentes identificados são...",
#       "context_quality": "rich",
#       "created_at": "2026-03-03T14:31:05+00:00"
#     }
#   ]
# }
#
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat/{{conversation_id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################################################
# 7. ARQUIVAR CONVERSA (SOFT DELETE)
###############################################################################

### Arquivar conversa
# A conversa não será mais listada como ativa, mas o histórico é preservado.
#
# Resposta esperada:
# {
#   "status": "archived",
#   "conversation_id": "uuid"
# }
#
DELETE {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat/{{conversation_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Após arquivar, tentar enviar mensagem retorna 400:
### {"detail": "Conversa arquivada"}

###############################################################################
# 8. JANELA MENSAL
###############################################################################

### Criar conversa com janela mensal
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat?window=month
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################################################
# 9. CENÁRIOS DE ERRO
###############################################################################

### Categoria não suportada (→ 400)
# {"detail": "Chat não disponível para a categoria 'advice_request'. Categorias suportadas: pain_and_anger, solution_request"}
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/advice_request/chat?window=week
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Janela inválida (→ 400)
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat?window=year
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Conversa inexistente (→ 404)
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/messages?window=week
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question": "teste"
}

###

### Conversa arquivada (→ 400)
# Primeiro arquive a conversa com DELETE, depois tente enviar mensagem

###

### Pergunta muito curta — min_length=3 (→ 422)
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat/{{conversation_id}}/messages?window=week
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question": "oi"
}

###

### Audiência inexistente (→ 404)
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat?window=week
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Sem autenticação (→ 401)
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/themes/intents/pain_and_anger/chat?window=week
content-type: application/json
